OL,3,AToo early to say who was behind
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack, Israeli
OL,5,APM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu has said it is too early to
OL,9,Fsay who was behind the foiled attempt
OL,10,Fby a co-pilot to crash an Emirati
OL,11,Fflight from Dubai to Tel Aviv.
OL,13,FAsked by Fox News whether there was any
OL,14,Findication of Iran's involvement,
OL,15,FNetanyahu replied: "It's too early to
OL,16,Fsay."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
