OL,3,AToo early to say who was behind
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack, Israeli
OL,5,APM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said the attacking pilot was being
OL,8,Finvestigated in Saudi Arabia, where he
OL,9,Fwas arrested after the Flydubai plane
OL,10,Fmade an emergency landing, and he
OL,11,Fexpected him to be taken to the United
OL,12,FArab Emirates, which is where the plane
OL,13,Ftook off.
OL,15,FShaken passengers have described how
OL,16,Fthey burst into the cockpit and
OL,17,Fwrestled with the attacker, even as the
OL,18,Faircraft descended sharply.
